{"contentDigest":"e5b6ce5b0bb3980d75b3086ad6d0516cc677768f1f1b67c99ebac633a0ab2d6c","definition":{"coursePackage":{"course":{"certificate":{"enabled":true,"statement":"Completed this Finney learning course.","title":"Claude Cowork Setup Completion"},"description":"Get Claude Cowork fully configured and running your first real task — in one sitting.","estimatedDurationMinutes":140,"extensions":{"finney.legacy.program-id":"062f62e3-c752-4333-814b-b8a49abc5b31"},"intendedAudience":["Registered Finney learners"],"learningOutcomes":["Apply the methods taught in Claude Cowork Setup."],"modules":[{"description":"Everything starts here before you touch anything else.","extensions":{"finney.legacy.module-id":"dd70cde2-e9c7-4fb6-835f-e5c512212772"},"id":"module.dd70cde2-e9c7-4fb6-835f-e5c512212772","lessons":[{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.5bb2a4b8-c911-4950-aa31-e5b2b329bebe","title":"Download Claude Desktop","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Go to claude.ai, download the desktop app, and install it. Open it and sign in.","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"5bb2a4b8-c911-4950-aa31-e5b2b329bebe"},"id":"lesson.5bb2a4b8-c911-4950-aa31-e5b2b329bebe","order":1,"resources":[],"title":"Download Claude Desktop"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.900477bc-5f53-40ac-947a-285b4ab757d7","title":"Upgrade to Pro","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Go to Settings → Plan → Upgrade to Pro ($20/mo). You need this to access Cowork features. No Pro, no Cowork.","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"900477bc-5f53-40ac-947a-285b4ab757d7"},"id":"lesson.900477bc-5f53-40ac-947a-285b4ab757d7","order":2,"resources":[],"title":"Upgrade to Pro"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.3932ac3b-55ae-4633-a56a-55cbb453cd3f","title":"Find the Cowork Tab","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Once you're on Pro, you'll see the **Cowork tab** at the top of the app. Click it. This is where everything lives.\n\n---","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"3932ac3b-55ae-4633-a56a-55cbb453cd3f"},"id":"lesson.3932ac3b-55ae-4633-a56a-55cbb453cd3f","order":3,"resources":[],"title":"Find the Cowork Tab"}],"order":1,"title":"Get the App Ready"},{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.module-id":"7e3eede4-ad75-4e0c-b819-11efd422deb5"},"id":"module.7e3eede4-ad75-4e0c-b819-11efd422deb5","lessons":[{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.03195da7-2b2a-4d9f-b949-4035a57c8114","title":"Create Your Main Folder","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"On your computer, create a folder called **CLAUDE COWORK**. This is where all your work will live.","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"03195da7-2b2a-4d9f-b949-4035a57c8114"},"id":"lesson.03195da7-2b2a-4d9f-b949-4035a57c8114","order":1,"resources":[],"title":"Create Your Main Folder"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.4e0250bd-eedd-442f-8d24-b33db3232d3d","title":"Add Your Subfolders","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Inside that folder, create these four folders:\n\n- **About Me**\n- **Projects**\n- **Templates**\n- **Output Files**\n\n---","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"4e0250bd-eedd-442f-8d24-b33db3232d3d"},"id":"lesson.4e0250bd-eedd-442f-8d24-b33db3232d3d","order":2,"resources":[],"title":"Add Your Subfolders"}],"order":2,"title":"Build Your Folder Structure"},{"description":"These two files do the heavy lifting. They replace long prompts forever.","extensions":{"finney.legacy.module-id":"d5a4b8d6-bb87-420c-b800-b006a4460124"},"id":"module.d5a4b8d6-bb87-420c-b800-b006a4460124","lessons":[{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.a85576d1-a38d-4594-8612-88641c3f7414","title":"Create about-me.md","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Inside your **About Me** folder, create a file called `about-me.md`. Write:\n\n- Who you are\n- What you do\n- How you like to work\n- Your tone and communication style","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"a85576d1-a38d-4594-8612-88641c3f7414"},"id":"lesson.a85576d1-a38d-4594-8612-88641c3f7414","order":1,"resources":[],"title":"Create about-me.md"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.0a0ae4a1-7193-422c-8691-eb2a9f633379","title":"Create anti-ai-style.md","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Create a second file called `anti-ai-style.md`. Write every word, phrase, and sentence structure you never want Claude to use. Think:\n\n- *\"Delve into\"*\n- *\"It's important to note\"*\n- *\"Certainly!\"*\n- Any buzzwords that sound robotic\n\n---","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"0a0ae4a1-7193-422c-8691-eb2a9f633379"},"id":"lesson.0a0ae4a1-7193-422c-8691-eb2a9f633379","order":2,"resources":[],"title":"Create anti-ai-style.md"}],"order":3,"title":"Write Your .md Files"},{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.module-id":"74d1718c-f2c3-47bc-a571-ccaae3b4b946"},"id":"module.74d1718c-f2c3-47bc-a571-ccaae3b4b946","lessons":[{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.162118ef-e55d-4d00-838b-b159db1f7bae","title":"Open Global Instructions","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Go to **Settings → Cowork → Edit Global Instructions.**","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"162118ef-e55d-4d00-838b-b159db1f7bae"},"id":"lesson.162118ef-e55d-4d00-838b-b159db1f7bae","order":1,"resources":[],"title":"Open Global Instructions"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.5eae2886-9135-429a-bc94-bc5c6bc929f5","title":"Write Your Rules","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Tell Claude:\n\n- Where your folders are\n- Your file naming conventions (e.g. `2024-01-task-name.docx`)\n- Which files to read before every task (`about-me.md`, `anti-ai-style.md`)\n\nYou write this once. It runs automatically every single time.\n\n---","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"5eae2886-9135-429a-bc94-bc5c6bc929f5"},"id":"lesson.5eae2886-9135-429a-bc94-bc5c6bc929f5","order":2,"resources":[],"title":"Write Your Rules"}],"order":4,"title":"Set Your Global Instructions"},{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.module-id":"dcd5154b-92fc-40f8-8918-18d60d9ef086"},"id":"module.dcd5154b-92fc-40f8-8918-18d60d9ef086","lessons":[{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.74fae91e-e24b-4b4d-9d4a-8e03d82b1b78","title":"Start a New Project","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Go to **Cowork → Projects → +**. Name it after a task you do every week.","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"74fae91e-e24b-4b4d-9d4a-8e03d82b1b78"},"id":"lesson.74fae91e-e24b-4b4d-9d4a-8e03d82b1b78","order":1,"resources":[],"title":"Start a New Project"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.a25a17fe-54ed-4507-b8c6-6ecd0588e8ec","title":"Why This Matters","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Projects have scoped memory. Claude remembers what it did last session. You stop re-explaining your context every time you open the app.\n\n---","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"a25a17fe-54ed-4507-b8c6-6ecd0588e8ec"},"id":"lesson.a25a17fe-54ed-4507-b8c6-6ecd0588e8ec","order":2,"resources":[],"title":"Why This Matters"}],"order":5,"title":"Create Your First Project"},{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.module-id":"847d63df-061b-4c7d-a977-253496a0bb7a"},"id":"module.847d63df-061b-4c7d-a977-253496a0bb7a","lessons":[{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.c3093ffa-868d-4a6a-ada9-a48b78f60538","title":"Use This Prompt Structure","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Type: *\"I want to [your task]. Ask me questions first.\"*\n\nClaude will ask you clarifying questions before doing anything. You direct. It builds.","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"c3093ffa-868d-4a6a-ada9-a48b78f60538"},"id":"lesson.c3093ffa-868d-4a6a-ada9-a48b78f60538","order":1,"resources":[],"title":"Use This Prompt Structure"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.19af4255-f9a2-4fd8-bf4a-94339d4026dd","title":"Add AskUserQuestion to Every Prompt","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Always include *\"Use AskUserQuestion\"* in your prompts. Claude generates a clickable form to fill in — instead of you writing a long prompt every time.","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"19af4255-f9a2-4fd8-bf4a-94339d4026dd"},"id":"lesson.19af4255-f9a2-4fd8-bf4a-94339d4026dd","order":2,"resources":[],"title":"Add AskUserQuestion to Every Prompt"},{"activities":[{"extensions":{"finney.legacy.activity-config":{},"finney.legacy.activity-type":"content","finney.legacy.attachments":[]},"id":"activity.0afe6531-87dc-4e74-8574-095ae1981187","title":"Schedule a Repeating Task","type":"content"}],"completionRule":{"type":"learner-self-completion"},"content":"Tell Claude: *\"Every Monday at 8am, create my weekly work briefing.\"*\n\nYou wake up to a finished document in your Output Files folder. That's the whole point.# Claude Cowork Setup: Done in 1 Hour\n\nGet Claude Cowork fully configured and running your first real task — in one sitting.","evidenceRequirements":[],"extensions":{"finney.legacy.is-critical":false,"finney.legacy.persona-variations":{},"finney.legacy.step-id":"0afe6531-87dc-4e74-8574-095ae1981187"},"id":"lesson.0afe6531-87dc-4e74-8574-095ae1981187","order":3,"resources":[],"title":"Schedule a Repeating Task"}],"order":6,"title":"Run Your First Real Task"}],"title":"Claude Cowork Setup"},"manifest":{"assets":[],"authorship":[{"id":"author.c468d6e8-b872-4be1-9282-22b32deb68ed","kind":"organization","name":"Finance Guides"}],"compatibility":{"canonicalizationVersion":"1.0.0","optionalCapabilities":[],"requiredCapabilities":["learning-core"],"requiredExtensions":[]},"contentDigest":"sha256:8e5445607da59c4f714a640d01acd7f0e2a67743963f67b7e3b21fb2eb6e3997","description":"Get Claude Cowork fully configured and running your first real task — in one sitting.","extensions":{"finney.legacy.cover-image":null,"finney.legacy.global-info":null,"finney.legacy.images":[],"finney.legacy.personas":[],"finney.legacy.source-url":null,"finney.legacy.tags":[],"finney.legacy.tier":"free"},"issuer":{"id":"issuer.c468d6e8-b872-4be1-9282-22b32deb68ed","kind":"organization","name":"Finance Guides"},"lineageId":"finney.course.program.062f62e3-c752-4333-814b-b8a49abc5b31","packageId":"finney.course.program.062f62e3-c752-4333-814b-b8a49abc5b31","packageVersion":"1.0.0","provenance":{"extensions":{"finney.source.program-digest":"sha256:7a4b7975355f5c38daeda1db7e0d611010c7584215e43a816645d76cb304b719","finney.source.program-id":"062f62e3-c752-4333-814b-b8a49abc5b31","finney.source.program-slug":"claude-cowork-setup-done-in-1-hour","finney.source.program-updated-at":"2026-04-27T12:18:38.491Z"},"kind":"original"},"publisher":{"id":"publisher.c468d6e8-b872-4be1-9282-22b32deb68ed","kind":"publisher","name":"Finance Guides"},"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","title":"Claude Cowork Setup","versionNotes":"Converted from an approved Finney Finance Program."}}},"dependencies":[],"entityId":"finney.course.program.062f62e3-c752-4333-814b-b8a49abc5b31-1.0.0-b3e1f64adb303bee","excludedContent":["availability, invitations, access codes, an